  m_Text: 'HOW TO USE NODE TOOL:

    -Select a Target node

    -Select from custom tool dialog

    -Click circles - green is selected node

    -Click selected node to begin adding a new one

    To confirm new node:

    Space/1: 1 bar

    3 - 2 bars (2 is bound in Unity)

    4 - 3 bars


    You can also click an existing node''s circle to link it to the selected one instead
    of making a new node.


    Press `(back quote) with tool active to generate names'
